WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
lens

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,320
Don't admit it

3
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:05,030
Three years ago, would you have gritted your teeth and refused to admit it?

4
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:07,430
Don’t admit it even if you come out three years later.

5
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:12,030
I can't stand the psychological torture anymore

6
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:15,890
three years ago

7
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:18,470
I kneel in front of the heavenly gate of God’s house

8
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:20,300
a whole moonlit night

9
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:24,160
You don't give me five minutes today

10
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,060
What else can be explained

11
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:30,410
I've done my work and I've been punished.

12
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:34,880
It is already redundant to explain or not to explain, or should I say

13
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:37,420
Mr. Shen, you want to throw me in there again?

14
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:43,160
How long will it take this time, three years, five years, ten years?

15
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:46,170
It is already redundant to explain or not.

16
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:48,510
You admitted it yourself

17
00:00:48,870 --> 00:00:50,190
You owe a life

18
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,920
Then what are you going to do to repay this life?

19
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:58,100
I still don’t know if the rest of my life is enough

20
00:00:58,220 --> 00:00:59,620
I will continue to pay it back in the next life.

21
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:00,820
If it's still unclear

22
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:01,900
Just keep paying it back

23
00:01:02,290 --> 00:01:03,730
There will always be a day when you can pay it off
